#: ../../language/error_codes/E4234.md:1
msgid "E4234"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4234.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `regex_kind_mismatch`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`regex_kind_mismatch`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4234.md:5
msgid ""
"The regex kind does not match the input kind. Text regexes (`re\"...\"` "
"and `Regex` constants) match text; byte regexes (`reb\"...\"` and "
"`BytesRegex` constants) match bytes."
msgstr ""
"正则表达式的种类与输入不匹配。文本正则表达式（`re\"...\"` 和 `Regex` 常量）匹配文本；字节正则表达式（`reb\"...\"`"
" 和 `BytesRegex` 常量）匹配字节。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4234.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4234.md:11
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn matches(text : String) -> Bool {\n"
"  ignore(text)\n"
"  text =~ reb\"abc\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4234.md:15
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4234.md:17
msgid ""
"Use a text regex for text input, or a byte regex for byte input. Changing"
" the regex kind does not convert the input between text and bytes."
msgstr "文本输入应使用文本正则表达式，字节输入应使用字节正则表达式。改变正则表达式的种类不会在文本与字节之间转换输入。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4234.md:20
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn matches(text : String) -> Bool {\n"
"  text =~ re\"abc\"\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"test {\n"
"  assert_true(matches(\"abc\"))\n"
"  assert_false(matches(\"123\"))\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
